### 1. Register Admin User
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "System Admin",
  "username": "admin.fawes@clinic.com",
  "password": "12345678",
  "phone": "555-0100",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

